## Getting Started

### Prerequisites

- [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/) 20+
- [pnpm](https://pnpm.io/)
- [just](https://just.systems/)

### Installation

```sh
pnpm install
cp .env.example .env
```

### Running

```sh
just dev
```

The app will be available at `http://localhost:5173`.

## Development

```sh
# Check formatting and linting
just fmt
just lint

# Fix formatting and linting
just fmt-fix
just lint-fix

# Run type checker
just typecheck
```

## Testing

```sh
# Run unit tests
just test-unit

# Run all tests
just test-all

# Full pre-push check
just gate
```

## Deployment

```sh
# Build Docker image
docker build -t {{ project_name }} .

# Run container
docker run -p 8080:8080 {{ project_name }}
```

